Qhn972j_DdfjUOzVFFQqyek7tjKWXDQ&oe=6A902534"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "899487156435844", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302483_899487159769177_8366256816835694172_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s_gJItd9VtcQ7kNvwFNgeDt&_nc_oc=Adq_NebMKN3eJcGQevtGUBMF-KuiMsIt0cu4KiNlwwbt8wDu0aW3rSK5WEwkI4mv-fY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEDHePF3HUvP76IhpDwiX44i8IJ5VtrdOk7Vq65xdUoEA&oe=6A903A6D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "4X4 Driving VR", "keywords": ["simulator", "vehicle", "driving", "racing", "4X4"], "long_description": "Enter 4X4 Driving VR and experience the thrill of off-road adventure built for Meta Quest. Drive powerful truck vehicles through multiple environments filled with deep mud, rough rocks, hills, and obstacles. Every level challenges your skills as you complete missions and conquer difficult terrain.\n\nEnjoy immersive driving with smooth controls and realistic vehicle movement. Climb steep mountains, cross dangerous paths, and test your precision in exciting climb race challenges. Whether you enjoy casual fun or skill-based gameplay, this VR experience combines realism with fast-paced action.\n\n**Features**\n- Realistic driving with immersive VR controls\n- Powerful truck vehicles for off-road challenges\n- Environments filled with mud, rocks, and hills\n- Fun simulator game and casual arcade game gameplay\n\nStart your engine and enjoy the ultimate adventure drive experience. If you love off-road vehicles, racing challenges, and realistic simulation games, 4X4 Driving VR is ready for you.", "short_description": "Take control of powerful vehicles in 4X4 Driving VR. Enjoy intense driving across wild environments filled with mud, rocks, and steep paths. Master every truck challenge with realistic handling and complete exciting targets. A fun simulator game packed with adventure drive action and casual arcade game thrills."}]}, 